{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he fashioned it.</b> That he was making forms in it in order to delay and stall until Moses would come, and all his intent was for the sake of Heaven, as we find that Scripture praises him, as it is written: ״כי שפתי כהן ישמרו דעת״, and it is written: ״ורבים השיב מעון״ — this is the sin of the calf. And had they killed him, they would have had no remedy, and there would have been fulfilled in them: ״אם יהרג במקדש ה' כהן ונביא״."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:27.303133256Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}